{
  "$schema": "arxa/theme@1",
  "comment": "Accent swatch SSOT. A swatch = 5 semantic roles per mode: accent (+on-accent), accent-soft, and three derived via color-mix (accent-surface, accent-text, accent-muted) — so each swatch authors two colors per mode and the roles stay coherent across light/dark (M3 tone-remap, Radix natural-pairing). services/theme_tokens.js is the only reader and generates assets/css/theme.css from this file — edit here, run `node services/theme_tokens.js`, commit both.",
  "default": "cyan",
  "roles": {
    "surfaceMix": 8,
    "textMix": 30,
    "mutedMix": 20
  },
  "swatches": [
